        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Olympia Dukakis, Norman Jewison, John Patrick Shanley, George T. Miller, Sigrid Thornton\n- Works: Moonstruck, Over the Hill\n- Topics: film acting, awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Olympia Dukakis transitioned to film acting and won an Academy Award, a Golden Globe, and a BAFTA nomination for her performance in \"Moonstruck\".\n- \"Moonstruck\" is a 1987 American romantic comedy film directed by Norman Jewison and written by John Patrick Shanley.\n- In 1992, \"Over the Hill\" was released as an Australian drama film directed by George T. Miller and starring Olympia Dukakis and Sigrid Thornton.",
